# Correct: EBK-style kriging on a 10 km grid with a cross-validation of the surfaces and an L1 logistic
# MaxEnt-type model (maxnet formulation, clamping); the global probability raster uses a centre-based
# shallow-water mask instead of an all-touched one.
# The steps run as separate blocks in one namespace; a block that raises is skipped.
